    "language": "lzh",
    "description": "1892 年《點石齋畫報》匏一第五圖〈瞽目復明〉報導福州一位長期失明的患者到濟世醫館求診，描述院內西醫診察、施治與報紙所記的轉歸。這則圖文可用於研究晚清福建的就醫經驗、西醫院形象與新聞如何報導患者。",
    "description_en": "Gu mu fu ming [Sight Restored], published in the Dianshizhai Pictorial in 1892, reports that a patient who had long been blind sought care at the Jishi Hospital in Fuzhou. The article recounts an examination, treatment and the outcome reported by the newspaper. It provides an illustrated source for the history of care seeking and the portrayal of Western hospitals in late Qing Fujian.",
    "txt_reader_statement": "從右半讀至左半，各面正文依直欄自右往左。篇題、版記與圖款另錄。文末附連讀全文。□ 表示未定字。",
    "tei_editorial_statement": "依第417幅逐欄錄兩面完整圖說。另標篇題、畫款、刊記與印記位置。連讀全文按原欄序串接。",
